Package: PreferenceMapping
Type: Package
Title: Preference Mapping by 5 different models of Unfolding and PrefMaX
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Pascal Schlich 
Maintainer: The package maintainer <pascal.schlich@inrae.fr>
Description: Internal Unfolding for a product by subject matrix of liking scores.
    External Unfolding for constraining the products to be the first PCs of the product variables (for instance sensory descriptors).
    Restricted-Prod Unfolding for constraining the axes to be linear combinations of the product variables.
    Restricted-Subj Unfolding for constraining the axes to be linear combinations of the subject variables (for instance demographics).
    Restricted-Both Unfolding for constraining axes to be both linear combinations of product and subject variables.
    PrefMaX as a PCA of individual optimal levels of product variables by quadratic regressions weighted by fit qualities.
